{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909847-examples-of-clues-and-elements-from-chronicles-2e-handbook","id":909847,"title":"Examples of Clues and Elements from Chronicles 2e Handbook","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-07T22:12:24-07:00","id":909847,"title":"Examples of Clues and Elements from Chronicles 2e Handbook","content":"Hi guys. I just got done reading the rules on investigation for CoD that are found on page 78 of the Chronicles of Darkness core rules. I'm having trouble really envisioning what some Clues, and their Elements might be. Can we have a thread of some example Clues with included Elements to the end of elucidating what is meant by this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10158-thestranjer","name":"TheStranjer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10158_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T07:14:35-07:00","id":910053,"title":"","content":"&quot;Likes dogs&quot;, 1 element.<br /> &quot;Knife wound&quot;, 1 element.<br /> &quot;It was done at night&quot;, 2 elements.<br /> &quot;Definitely not human&quot;, 2 elements.<br /> &quot;Takes immense pleasure from it&quot;, 2 elements.<br /> &quot;Loves to talk about bunnies&quot;, 1 element.<br /> And so on. Almost anything can be a Clue, depending on context.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T11:04:21-07:00","id":910198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909847-examples-of-clues-and-elements-from-chronicles-2e-handbook?p=910053#post910053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Likes dogs&quot;, 1 element.<br /> &quot;Knife wound&quot;, 1 element.<br /> &quot;It was done at night&quot;, 2 elements.<br /> &quot;Definitely not human&quot;, 2 elements.<br /> &quot;Takes immense pleasure from it&quot;, 2 elements.<br /> &quot;Loves to talk about bunnies&quot;, 1 element.<br /> And so on. Almost anything can be a Clue, depending on context.</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://flowersinmywords.files.wordpress.com/2011/09/were-bunny.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T20:33:35-07:00","id":910520,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909847-examples-of-clues-and-elements-from-chronicles-2e-handbook?p=910053#post910053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Likes dogs&quot;, 1 element.<br /> &quot;Knife wound&quot;, 1 element.<br /> &quot;It was done at night&quot;, 2 elements.<br /> &quot;Definitely not human&quot;, 2 elements.<br /> &quot;Takes immense pleasure from it&quot;, 2 elements.<br /> &quot;Loves to talk about bunnies&quot;, 1 element.<br /> And so on. Almost anything can be a Clue, depending on context.</div> </div> </div> </div>So if these are Elements, what is a Clue?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10158-thestranjer","name":"TheStranjer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10158_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T21:16:41-07:00","id":910543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheStranjer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909847-examples-of-clues-and-elements-from-chronicles-2e-handbook?p=910520#post910520\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So if these are Elements, what is a Clue?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, those are Clues. They each have a number of a meta-game resources called Elements that can be spent to earn bonus dice on relevant rolls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T04:20:43-07:00","id":910681,"title":"","content":"Clue is anything that can progress you towards figuring out the mystery. Elements are, basically, a way to put a number on &quot;how much does this Clue moves you towards solving the Mystery?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T06:46:53-07:00","id":910739,"title":"","content":"Elements are basically the dice bonus each Clue has. So, if one Clue is worth +2 dice, then that's 2 elements. The catch is that you don't have to use the full bonus at once; so, you could choose to use the +2 dice bonus from example above spread over two rolls at +1 dice each.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T09:10:31-07:00","id":911704,"title":"","content":"Wait, is there a system in CoD that is not included in God-Machine/Wod2nd core book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/824-araknee","name":"Araknee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar824_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T09:18:00-07:00","id":911708,"title":"","content":"Yes. Chase System, Equipment Building System, Horror System, and Investigation System. These things are only in 2nd Core Book, and not in the GMC","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T09:29:13-07:00","id":911712,"title":"","content":"Oh .. damn. Is the combat system the same that in GMC ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/824-araknee","name":"Araknee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar824_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T09:34:09-07:00","id":911717,"title":"","content":"Yes, it is. There are also some new merits. However, some of the new subsystems are hit or miss; they might fit yourplaystyle and be very useful, or be incompatible, and thus useless. Be wary of that before deciding to/if upgrade to 2nd ED core.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T10:05:23-07:00","id":911729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Araknee</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909847-examples-of-clues-and-elements-from-chronicles-2e-handbook?p=911704#post911704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, is there a system in CoD that is not included in God-Machine/Wod2nd core book?</div> </div> </div> </div>Chronicles of Darkness <i>is</i> the 2nd edition core book. It added a couple of optional systems that were not in The God-Machine Chronicle, specifically Chases, Investigations, Crafting Equipment, and a system for designing custom monsters, similar to the one from 1e Hunter.<br /> <br /> All of them are self-contained and don't tie into any other systems or splat-specific mechanics, so you don't need them to play, but they're cool modular options. Personally, I don't care for the Investigation system and don't use it myself, but I love the chase system, and the Crafting Equipment system is one of the most practical and easy to use crafting systems I've seen in an RPG. Horrors I haven't gotten much use out of yet, but it's got a lot of potential.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T23:56:28-07:00","id":912129,"title":"","content":"Advise from one running few Investigation right now - try to use Clues as <i>meaningful</i> informations. And what it would be will be based on the Investigation matter itself.<br /> <br /> In classical mortal game of &quot;who killed this lady&quot; shoe number, placing of weapon, etc. will be suitable Clues. In <b>Mage</b> Abyssal Intruder Investigation things like existence of weird theatrical play leading people to madness, occurrences of Ley Lines shift or rumors on real reason for Great Fire of London will be better Clues - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/895970-%E2%80%8B-2e-mystery-yellow-sign-hallows-network-corruption-and-abyssal-astral-realm\">I literally made Intruder on those</a>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-11T08:13:56-07:00","id":912243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909847-examples-of-clues-and-elements-from-chronicles-2e-handbook?p=910543#post910543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, those are Clues. They each have a number of a meta-game resources called Elements that can be spent to earn bonus dice on relevant rolls.</div> </div> </div> </div>That makes more sense. I understand. Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10158-thestranjer","name":"TheStranjer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10158_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}